I started playing this game in the beta, and its fantastic. Amazing actually. The actual system they have for this game is top tier, and its really fun to play with friends too. The only problem I have with this game is that nobody is playing it, if you're not playing with friends, you'll have to wait a long♥♥♥♥♥time to get a match. Theres just not enough of a community playing this game, which is a shame because it really deserves one.
