It's a really fun game that lets you build your character in many different ways. The story and comedy are standard for xianxia/wuxia novels. The game is translated well enough up until year 2, where it gets bonkers, with entire conversations in chinese.
Some points:
- Not 100% translated;
- Multitude of characters, each with his/her own personality;
- Many waifus;
- Choices that are skill-dependent (F:NV style);
- Good replay value;
- Lots of mini-games;
- Lots of weapons and styles to choose;
- Can't really customize your character's looks;
- Multiple endings;
- Time-based activities;
- Buggier than your mom after going to the dockyard.
The goods and bads are mixed together, you choose what is what. Overall, a good if unfinished game.
I'd say wait for a sale.

